{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"text":"I'll analyze the recommendation task. Let me understand the requirements:\n\n- Target: 20 distinct candidates\n- Interest: 家常烹饪 (home cooking), focusing on reproducible methods, ingredient handling, and cooking principles. Explicitly NOT interested in restaurant business operations or kitchen appliance promotions.\n- Working set: 80 candidates exposed\n\nLet me review the candidates. The interest explicitly excludes content about 餐饮门店经营 (restaurant operations) or 厨电促销 (kitchen appliance promotions). Many candidates are \"市场观察\" (market observation) type articles that analyze restaurant chains, franchise contracts, delivery promotions, and kitchen appliance discounts - these should be excluded.\n\nLet me categorize the candidates by their content type based on descriptions:\n\n**Market observation (市场观察)** - EXCLUDE (restaurant operations/appliance promos):\n- item-18affaa8aa1e (鸡胸肉口感 市场观察)\n- item-1c455877dcbb (蒸鱼 市场观察)\n- item-20be4b3109e6 (番茄炒蛋 市场观察)\n- item-29a2ceb5a219 (蒸鱼 市场观察)\n- item-2bc251faf37d (蔬菜焯水 市场观察)\n- item-2dd514471f2d (煎豆腐 市场观察)\n- item-30ba6b1bdace (面团发酵 市场观察)\n- item-31ef127a8f01 (番茄炒蛋 市场观察)\n- item-3b75b14db3a2 (米饭含水量 市场观察)\n- item-3ccd8e917ed5 (米饭含水量 市场观察)\n- item-45153d453613 (鸡胸肉口感 市场观察)\n- item-48f6b3f401da (鸡胸肉口感 市场观察)\n- item-494354763cad (面团发酵 市场观察)\n- item-510ecf76ae65 (蔬菜焯水 市场观察)\n- item-51661c044642 (蒸鱼 市场观察)\n- item-5499ab1667d3 (面团发酵 市场观察)\n- item-5752095dcba2 (煎豆腐 市场观察)\n\nWait, but I need to check which of these are actually in the working set of 80. The candidates list shows 80 candidates. Let me count what's actually exposed.\n\nActually, let me reconsider. The task says workingSetCount is 80. The candidates provided are the exposed working set. Let me identify all candidates and their types.\n\nLet me categorize the content types present:\n1. **概念速览 (concept overview)** - lists concepts, provides question directory\n2. **条件与原理 (conditions & principles)** - explains how moisture, temperature, structure affect texture\n3. **操作记录 (operation records)** - gives ingredient amounts, processing order, heating, adjustments\n4. **专题观察 (special topic observation)** - local food history, festivals, table manners, dish name evolution, folk stories\n5. **市场观察 (market observation)** - restaurant chains, franchise, delivery promos, kitchen appliance discounts\n\nThe interest is: 家常烹饪，关注可复现做法、食材处理和烹饪原理，不关注餐饮门店经营或厨电促销。\n\nSo the user wants:\n- Reproducible methods (操作记录)\n- Ingredient handling (食材处理)\n- Cooking principles (烹饪原理 - 条件与原理)\n- NOT restaurant operations or kitchen appliance promos (市场观察 - exclude)\n\nWhat about 概念速览 and 专题观察?\n\n概念速览 (concept overview): lists common concepts, provides question directory for further reading. This is about cooking concepts - relevant to cooking principles/understanding. Relevant.\n\n专题观察 (special topic observation): describes local food history, festivals, table manners, dish name evolution, folk stories. This is more about food culture/history rather than reproducible cooking methods. Hmm. The interest focuses on 可复现做法、食材处理和烹饪原理. Food history/culture is somewhat tangential but still cooking-related. However, given the interest's emphasis on reproducible methods and principles, the 专题观察 content (food history, folk stories) is less aligned. But it's not explicitly excluded.\n\nActually, let me reconsider. The interest says \"不关注餐饮门店经营或厨电促销\" - only explicitly excludes restaurant operations and appliance promos. So 专题观察 (food culture) is not excluded, though it's less aligned with the core focus.\n\nGiven we need 20 candidates and there are many relevant ones, I should prioritize the most aligned content:\n1. 操作记录 (reproducible methods) - most aligned\n2. 条件与原理 (cooking principles) - most aligned\n3. 概念速览 (concept overview) - aligned\n4. 专题观察 (food culture) - less aligned but not excluded\n\nLet me exclude 市场观察 entirely since it directly contradicts the interest.\n\nLet me count the non-market candidates available. Let