ure/folk stories - this is less aligned with the core interest of reproducible cooking methods and principles. Given the strong focus on practical cooking, I'll deprioritize 专题观察.\n\nThe 概念速览 content lists concepts and provides a question directory - this is aligned with understanding cooking concepts.\n\nSo my priority ranking:\n1. 操作记录 (reproducible methods) - highest alignment\n2. 条件与原理 (cooking principles) - highest alignment\n3. 概念速览 (concept overview) - aligned\n4. 专题观察 (food culture) - least aligned, deprioritize\n\nLet me count the strongly aligned candidates (操作记录 + 条件与原理):\n\n操作记录:\n- item-024e99402549 (煎饺 工作日备餐)\n- item-02ec789dd9bf (清汤调味 家庭周末午餐)\n- item-085ac75e2f6f (煎豆腐 家庭周末午餐)\n- item-1635bae1e58d (米饭含水量 家庭周末午餐)\n- item-1d12fb72a0b5 (蒸鱼 家庭周末午餐)\n- item-2062e507d111 (蒸鱼 两人晚餐)\n- item-2802591dd8c9 (蔬菜焯水 工作日备餐)\n- item-342993e68175 (炖牛肉 工作日备餐)\n- item-41f1925e3d74 (米饭含水量 工作日备餐)\n- item-4736b753745c (煎饺 家庭周末午餐)\n- item-47ec3b435037 (番茄炒蛋 两人晚餐)\n- item-52719ddc4224 (面团发酵 家庭周末午餐)\n- item-52c20cae5610 (蔬菜焯水 家庭周末午餐)\n- item-58677ff38120 (面团发酵 小份试做)\n\nThat's 14 操作记录.\n\n条件与原理:\n- item-0714769b6401 (煎豆腐 两人晚餐)\n- item-0ac37da79bac (蒸鱼 工作日备餐)\n- item-0ef03b868945 (鸡胸肉口感 小份试做)\n- item-1f7a4e5259fb (蔬菜焯水 小份试做)\n- item-20168695fc11 (清汤调味 家庭周末午餐)\n- item-20d117d62c34 (番茄炒蛋 两人晚餐)\n- item-2bd3f1c7d71a (面团发酵 家庭周末午餐)\n- item-3302498cd23d (煎饺 两人晚餐)\n- item-33a0f6fe41f5 (蒸鱼 小份试做)\n- item-34eb4892cc8d (蒸鱼 家庭周末午餐)\n- item-39131d1ff5ce (清汤调味 小份试做)\n- item-508ee443dfc5 (煎饺 小份试做)\n- item-5adc97f63de0 (煎豆腐 工作日备餐)\n- item-5b3fc88bc33f (鸡胸肉口感 工作日备餐)\n\nThat's 14 条件与原理.\n\nSo I have 28 strongly aligned candidates (操作记录 + 条件与原理). I need 20. \n\nI should aim for a balanced collection across dishes and content types. Let me consider the dishes involved:\n- 煎豆腐 (pan-fried tofu)\n- 煎饺 (pan-fried dumplings)\n- 米饭含水量 (rice water content)\n- 清汤调味 (clear soup seasoning)\n- 蒸鱼 (steamed fish)\n- 番茄炒蛋 (tomato scrambled eggs)\n- 鸡胸肉口感 (chicken breast texture)\n- 面团发酵 (dough fermentation)\n- 蔬菜焯水 (vegetable blanching)\n- 炖牛肉 (braised beef)\n\nI want to balance across dishes and content types. Let me select 20 from the 28 strong candidates, balancing both 操作记录 and 条件与原理 types and covering a variety of dishes.\n\nLet me aim for roughly 10 操作记录 and 10 条件与原理, covering diverse dishes.\n\nLet me select:\n\n操作记录 (choose ~10, diverse dishes):\n1. item-024e99402549 - 煎饺 工作日备餐\n2. item-02ec789dd9bf - 清汤调味 家庭周末午餐\n3. item-085ac75e2f6f - 煎豆腐 家庭周末午餐\n4. item-1635bae1e58d - 米饭含水量 家庭周末午餐\n5. item-1d12fb72a0b5 - 蒸鱼 家庭周末午餐\n6. item-2062e507d111 - 蒸鱼 两人晚餐\n7. item-2802591dd8c9 - 蔬菜焯水 工作日备餐\n8. item-342993e68175 - 炖牛肉 工作日备餐\n9. item-47ec3b435037 - 番茄炒蛋 两人晚餐\n10. item-58677ff38120 - 面团发酵 小份试做\n\n条件与原理 (choose ~10, diverse dishes):\n11. item-0714769b6401 - 煎豆腐 两人晚餐\n12. item-0ac37da79bac - 蒸鱼 工作日备餐\n13. item-0ef03b868945 - 鸡胸肉口感 小份试做\n14. item-1f7a4e5259fb - 蔬菜焯水 小份试做\n15. item-20168695fc11 - 清汤调味 家庭周末午餐\n16. item-20d117d62c34 - 番茄炒蛋 两人晚餐\n17. item-2bd3f1c7d71a - 面团发酵 家庭周末午餐\n18. item-3302498cd23d - 煎饺 两人晚餐\n19. item-34eb4892cc8d - 蒸鱼 家庭周末午餐\n20. item-5b3fc88bc33f - 鸡胸肉口感 工作日备餐\n\nHmm, this gives me 20 candidates. But let me reconsider balance. I have two 蒸鱼 操作记录 and two 蒸鱼 条件与原理, two 鸡胸肉 条件与原理. Let me check dish diversity.\n\nActually, let me reconsider. I want to balance across dishes. Let me count dishes in my selection:\n- 煎饺: item-024e99402549 (操作), item-3302498cd23d (原理) = 2\n- 清汤调味: item-02ec789dd9bf (操作), item-20168695fc11 (原理) = 2\n- 煎豆腐: item-085ac75e2f6f (操作), item-0714769b6401 (原理) = 2\n- 米饭含水量: item-1635bae1e58d (操作) = 1\n- 蒸鱼: item-1d12fb72a0b5 (操作), item-2062e507d111 (操作), item-0ac37da79bac (原理), item-34eb4892cc8d (原理) = 4\n- 蔬菜焯水: item-2802591dd8c9 (操作), item-1f7a4e5259fb (原理) = 2\n- 炖牛肉: item-342993e68175 (操作) = 1\n- 番茄炒蛋: item-47ec3b435037 (操作), item-20d117d62c34 (原理) = 2\n- 面团发酵: item-58677ff38120 (操作), item-2bd3f1c7d71a (原理) = 2\n- 鸡胸肉口感: item-0ef03b868945 (原理), item-5b3fc88bc33f (原理) = 2\n\nThat's 20. Reasonably balanced. But 蒸鱼 has 4 which is a bit heavy. Let me swap one 蒸鱼 for another dish to improve balance. \n\nActually, let me reconsider. I could replace one 蒸鱼 操作记录 (item-2062e507d111 两人晚餐) with another dish's 操作记录. But I've already used most dishes. Let me consider replacing item-2062e507d111 (蒸鱼 两人晚餐 操作) with item-41f1925e3d74 (米饭含水量 工作日备餐 操作) to give 米饭含水量 more representation, or item-4736b753745c (煎饺 家庭周末午餐 操作).\n\nHmm, but I already have 米饭含水量 1 and 煎饺 2. Let me think about what gives best balance.\n\nActually, let me reconsider whether to include 概念速览 items. The interest is about reproducible methods, ingredient handling, and cooking principles. 概念速览 provides concept overviews and question directories - it's a useful entry point for understanding cooking concepts. It's aligned but less directly actionable than 操作记录/条件与原理.\n\nGiven I have 28 strong candidates (操作+原理) and need only 20, I can fill entirely from the strongest aligned content. That's fine and keeps the collection tightly focused on the user's core interest.\n\nLet me refine my selection for better dish balance. Let me reduce 蒸鱼 to 2 and add variety.\n\nRevised selection:\n操作记录 (10):\n1. item-024e99402549 - 煎饺 工作日备餐\n2. item-02ec789dd9bf - 清汤调味 家庭周末午餐\n3. item-085ac75e2f6f - 煎豆腐 家庭周末午餐\n4. item-1635bae1e58d - 米饭含水量 家庭周末午餐\n5. item-1d12fb72a0b5 - 蒸鱼 家庭周末午餐\n6. item-2802591dd8c9 - 蔬菜焯水 工作日备餐\n7. item-342993e68175 - 炖牛肉 工作日备餐\n8. item-47ec3b435037 - 番茄炒蛋 两人晚餐\n9. item-58677ff38120 - 面团发酵 小份试做\n10. item-41f1925e3d74 - 米饭含水量 工作日备餐\n\n条件与原理 (10):\n11. item-0714769b6401 - 煎豆腐 两人晚餐\n12. item-0ac37da79bac - 蒸鱼 工作日备餐\n13. item-0ef03b868945 - 鸡胸肉口感 小份试做\n14. item-1f7a4e5259fb - 蔬菜焯水 小份试做\n15. item-20168695fc11 - 清汤调味 家庭周末午餐\n16. item-20d117d62c34 - 番茄炒蛋 两人晚餐\n17. item-2bd3f1c7d71a - 面团发酵 家庭周末午餐\n18. item-3302498cd23d - 煎饺 两人晚餐\n19. item-34eb4892cc8d - 蒸鱼 家庭周末午餐\n20. item-5b3fc88bc33f - 鸡胸肉口感 工作日备餐\n\nDish count now:\n- 煎饺: 2 (item-024e, item-3302)\n- 清汤调味: 2 (item-02ec, item-2016)\n- 煎豆腐: 2 (item-085a, item-0714)\n- 米饭含水量: 2 (item-1635, item-41f1)\n- 蒸鱼: 3 (item-1d12, item-0ac3, item-34eb)\n- 蔬菜焯水: 2 (item-2802, item-1f7a)\n- 炖牛肉: 1 (item-3429)\n- 番茄炒蛋: 2 (item-47ec, item-20d1)\n- 面团发酵: 2 (item-5867, item-2bd3)\n- 鸡胸肉口感: 2 (item-0ef0, item-5b3f)\n\nThat's 20. Good balance. 蒸鱼 has 3 which is acceptable given it's a common home dish.\n\nActually, let me reconsider whether I should include some 概念速览 items for a more balanced collection. The task says \"balanced across applicable Interests, Sources, and content types.\" Since all candidates are from the same source (Open Web) and same interest, content type balance matters. But the user's interest strongly emphasizes reproducible methods and principles. Including 概念速览 would add variety but they're less directly aligned.\n\nGiven the strong alignment of 操作记录 and 条件与原理 with the user's stated interest, and that I have exactly enough (28) to choose 20 from, I'll focus on these two most-aligned types. This keeps the collection tightly relevant.\n\nActually, let me reconsider. The instruction says \"balanced across applicable Interests, Sources, and content types.\" I think a mix is good but the primary driver is relevance. Since the user explicitly wants reproducible methods, ingredient handling, and cooking principles, the 操作记录 and 条件与原理 types are the most relevant. I'll go with my 20 selections.\n\nLet me verify all 20 candidates are in the exposed working set and distinct. Yes, all are in the list.\n\nNow let me write specific, fact-grounded recommendation reasons for each. Each reason should explain why the content is relevant to the user (home cooking, reproducible methods, ingredient handling, cooking principles), not just repeat the title.\n\nLet me draft reasons:\n\n1. item-024e99402549 (煎饺 工作日备餐 操作记录): Provides ingredient amounts, processing order, heating intensity/time, batch comparison, and adjustment steps for overcooked/watery/undercooked dumplings - directly matches the user's interest in reproducible home cooking methods for weekday meal prep.\n\n2. item-02ec789dd9bf (清汤调味 家庭周末午餐 操作记录): Gives concrete seasoning amounts and adjustment steps for clear soup, matching the user's focus on reproducible methods and ingredient handling in home cooking.\n\n3. item-085ac75e2f6f (煎豆腐 家庭周末午餐 操作记录): Records ingredient quantities, heating control, and troubleshooting for pan-fried tofu - aligns with reproducible home cooking and ingredient handling.\n\n4. item-1635bae1e58d (米饭含水量 家庭周末午餐 操作记录): Documents water ratios and adjustment steps for rice texture, matching the user's interest in ingredient handling and reproducible results.\n\n5. item-1d12fb72a0b5 (蒸鱼 家庭周末午餐 操作记录): Provides steaming amounts, timing, and correction steps for doneness/moisture - relevant to reproducible home cooking of fish.\n\n6. item-2802591dd8c9 (蔬菜焯水 工作日备餐 操作记录): Gives blanching amounts, heating control, and adjustment steps - matches ingredient handling interest for weekday prep.\n\n7. item-342993e68175 (炖牛肉 工作日备餐 操作记录): Records braising amounts, heating, and troubleshooting - reproducible home cooking method.\n\n8. item-47ec3b435037 (番茄炒蛋 两人晚餐 操作记录): Provides ingredient amounts and processing order for a classic home dish, matching reproducible cooking interest.\n\n9. item-58677ff38120 (面团发酵 小份试做 操作记录): Documents fermentation amounts, timing, and adjustment steps - matches reproducible method interest.\n\n10. item-41f1925e3d74 (米饭含水量 工作日备餐 操作记录): Water ratio and adjustment steps for weekday rice - ingredient handling.\n\n11. item-0714769b6401 (煎豆腐 两人晚餐 条件与原理): Explains how moisture, temperature, and tofu structure affect texture and what changes when substituting ingredients - directly matches the user's interest in cooking principles.\n\n12. item-0ac37da79bac (蒸鱼 工作日备餐 条件与原理): Explains how moisture/temperature/structure affect steamed fish texture and substitution effects - cooking principles.\n\n13. item-0ef03b868945 (鸡胸肉口感 小份试做 条件与原理): Explains factors affecting chicken breast texture and boundaries of different treatments - cooking principles.\n\n14. it